      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are dragon rugs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Dragon rugs are rugs printed with dragon artwork. Chillgen's Dragon Rugs collection has 26 designs priced from $21.90 to $139.85. Most are round rugs with dragon and library bookshelf scenes, and the range also includes mini mats and rectangular area rugs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a 3D dragon rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A 3D dragon rug has artwork printed to look deep, such as a spiral staircase or bookshelves that seem to sink into the floor. On Chillgen's dragon rugs, the 3D effect comes from the print. Twenty of the 26 product pages describe the surface as low pile."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is a dragon carpet the same as a dragon rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "People use both words for the same thing. Chillgen's dragon designs are sold as loose rugs in fixed sizes, from an 18\"x18\" mat up to 72\"x72\" squares and 5x8 ft rectangles, not as fitted carpet."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes does a dragon area rug come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Chillgen's dragon rugs come as mini mats from 20x14 to 36x24 inches, in an 18\"x18\" extra small size, in square sizes from 24\"x24\" to 72\"x72\" (used by the round designs), and as rectangular rugs from 2x3 ft to 5x8 ft. Prices start at $21.90, and not every design comes in every size."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I put a name on a dragon rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most Chillgen dragon rugs can be personalized: 24 of the 26 product pages say the rug is \"customizable with your name or text.\" Check that the page for your design offers it, and read what the text field accepts before ordering."
      }
    }
  ]
